 s=s.replace('Provider statements describe published offers, not independently audited performance.','Provider statements describe published offers, not independently audited performance. The buyer FAQ was reviewed through its current search-accessible primary text after direct retrieval failed; unseen signed contracts were not authenticated. The linked BNB process was also reviewed. This is document-based analysis, not firsthand testing or a review score. All cash figures are hypothetical.',1)
